Update of the Demo Version on May 13, 2025
BUG Fixes:
Fixed the problem of unclear card range;
Content Adjustments:
Adjusted the display specifications of keywords and numbers in the card descriptions, changed some of the card description contents, and displayed more real-time content in the card descriptions;
New Additions:
Added buttons such as the questionnaire, community, and wishlist on the homepage;
Added special guidance for the general store;
